{"id":"td-4136","category":"teardown","cover":"🔧","region":"global","publishedAt":"2026-08-29","tags":["拆解分析","奇瑞"],"title":{"zh":"【车灯拆解2606】艾瑞泽8 大灯","en":"","ko":""},"summary":{"zh":"今天，我们来看看奇瑞的明星车型 - 艾瑞泽8的大灯。\n\n这个级别跑量的车是最卷的车型之一，需兼顾造型和成本，才能在红海中生存下来，市场的销量给出终极答案。\n\n月均销量过万，2026","en":"","ko":""},"body":{"zh":"今天，我们来看看奇瑞的明星车型 - 艾瑞泽8的大灯。\n\n这个级别跑量的车是最卷的车型之一，需兼顾造型和成本，才能在红海中生存下来，市场的销量给出终极答案。\n\n月均销量过万，2026 年一季度累计销量 3.4 万，无不彰显着这个车型的成功；我们来看看灯：\n\n从灯的角度看，大灯犀利，造型原创，大灯官方命名“凌眸晶亮 LED 大灯”，整体是奇瑞家族化 “凌波钻切” 设计，远光近光椭球加上日行及流水转向，功能分布清晰，\n\n灯壳上的标识：\n\n整体外观：\n\n切开可见灯壳及椭球，面罩跟饰圈日行灯，结构清晰；\n\n拆除远近光椭球可见灯壳线束等；\n\n远近光椭球：\n\n近光椭球\n\n远光椭球\n\n饰圈+日行灯\n\n外饰圈及大厚壁\n\n灯板，三个灯板一共26颗灯珠，\n\n驱动器，\n\n整个大灯中规中矩，大灯供应商是安瑞。","en":"","ko":""},"source":{"name":{"zh":"车灯研究院","en":"Headlight Institute","ko":"차灯연구원"},"type":"web","url":"https://www.dengdengschool.com/article/dengjuchaijie/4136.html","author":""},"media":{"images":["https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bfpNckwxSiaMsuglictX6yVhSUgiclkmxSoUS9lktAy7HHub4JtYhW6p7y1YI5eib4kiaYAGTQWWRA3j51aZOAaa2vA/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg&watermark=1","https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/KTj61r3bYWGqDxjiaq5IQSPnu3J92w1t9d4LusguJWDwwbyX3P7swcBhWicPbeRTHGDbYp5icwANxiaFx6vxUJqRF0bCIKIfhkqhcUjUF9UDFTc/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg&watermark=1","https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/KTj61r3bYWEwJoR3X5NAj25uv9zpE751SHWad5nyuukHrmeZ8IbiatlenaUf9WpjebdEciaS2JJK8riaKo9hicaEEm6IuHnjmyLP3zDwbrtB0VQ/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg&watermark=1","https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/KTj61r3bYWG8HU4xZuGjQoQXJCGOay3oswqz8DZmPr8ljdYfkfDqkf7FL856Weiae4DwuR3tnCoM7Bfv24hic1oRLkZJa45jQ5DElkw7V862w/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg&watermark=1","https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/KTj61r3bYWFxSKphCpMmFuE8WvQCicNDrOoXN7n7CvUP7Wawy2Qn4lLiaPfia6uDc8H1N8tPIVbqRGok5BwwZNAuN43lGSgThMvfTSOITmvZYI/640?wx_fmt=gif&from=appmsg","https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/KTj61r3bYWEhSDsWhSgT3oBseNrsnz9f1XrzznDZEHtXIzIvtLLexm6obhSU6blbuAibpLP2N9IdKVQCBEVibeL5gl0qEnyw5dqVic7xCHAytI/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg&watermark=1","https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmb